{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47437","headline":"参同契明镜图诀诗二首 二 · 彭晓","name":"参同契明镜图诀诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至道希夷妙且深，烧丹先认大还心。\n日爻阴耦生真汞，月卦阳奇产正金。\n女妊朱砂男孕雪，北藏荧惑丙含壬。\n两端指的铅金祖，莫向诸般取次寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"彭晓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}